## 🧱 Notes
- Geometry Nodes now support *named attribute fields* and *real displacement export*.  
- Eevee 4.4 introduces *realtime displacement* and *screen-space indirect lighting*.  
- “Blender 4.5 Index” is part of the **knowledge-index.01** repository experiment for external memory linking.  
- ChatGPT can reference this file at:  
  👉 `https://github.com/jcalderman/knowledge-index.01/blob/main/Blender-4.5-index.md`

---

## 🧭 Usage
When prompting ChatGPT, include:  
> “Use the context from [Blender 4.5 Index](https://github.com/jcalderman/knowledge-index.01/blob/main/Blender-4.5-index.md).”

This allows AI assistants to cross-reference trusted Blender data live from GitHub rather than relying on internal memory.
